sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer Browser
    participant API as FastAPI Server
    participant DB as SQLAlchemy DB
    participant Pool as ThreadPoolExecutor
    participant Orch as ScanOrchestrator
    participant Target as Authorized Target App
    participant KB as Remediation KB

    Dev->>API: POST /api/projects/{id}/scans (profile, auth, ownership_confirmed)
    API->>API: Validate Pydantic v2 schema and ScopeGuardrail allow-list
    API->>DB: INSERT scans (status=queued, config_snapshot)
    API->>Pool: Submit run_scan(scan_id, cancel_event)
    API-->>Dev: 202 Accepted (scan_id, status=queued)

    Dev->>API: GET /api/scans/{id}/stream (EventSource SSE)
    Pool->>Orch: Start execution in worker thread
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE scans SET status=crawling, started_at=now
    Orch-->>API: Emit SSE phase_change (crawling)
    API-->>Dev: SSE data phase=crawling, progress=5%

    Orch->>Target: GET random non-existent path (Soft-404 calibration)
    Target-->>Orch: 404 or Soft-404 baseline signature

    loop BFS Crawl within depth, page and request caps
        Orch->>Target: Scoped rate-limited GET (respecting denylist)
        Target-->>Orch: HTML body, headers, cookies, status
        Orch->>Orch: Parse links, forms and params via BeautifulSoup4 + lxml
    end

    Orch->>DB: Bulk INSERT endpoints
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE scans SET status=scanning, endpoints_found=N
    Orch-->>API: Emit SSE phase_change (scanning)
    API-->>Dev: SSE data phase=scanning, endpoints_found=N

    loop For each profile-selected Check in CheckRegistry
        Orch->>Target: Execute passive analysis or safe active probe
        Target-->>Orch: HTTP response and timing
        Orch->>Orch: Deduplicate RawFinding via SHA-1 fingerprint
        Orch->>KB: Lookup plain explanation and multi-stack Before/After fix
        KB-->>Orch: EnrichedFinding payload
        Orch->>DB: INSERT findings
        Orch-->>API: Emit SSE finding_discovered and progress
        API-->>Dev: SSE data finding summary and progress_pct
    end

    Orch->>Orch: Compute risk_score (0-100) excluding false_positive
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE scans SET status=completed, risk_score, finished_at
    Orch-->>API: Emit SSE scan_completed
    API-->>Dev: SSE data status=completed, risk_score
    Dev->>API: GET /api/scans/{id}/findings
    API->>DB: SELECT findings JOIN endpoints
    API-->>Dev: 200 OK (Ranked findings + code fixes)
